SUMMARY:United Kingdom: Unfair dismissal qualifying period cut to six month
 s
DESCRIPTION:Starts in January 2027\; the source does not state the day. Upc
 oming\, Jan 2027. Under the Employment Rights Act timetable\, the unfair d
 ismissal qualifying period is reduced to six months\, and the cap on the c
 ompensatory award is removed\, from January 2027. The reduced qualifying p
 eriod applies to dismissals taking place from that date.\n\nSource: https:
 //www.davidsonmorris.com/employment-rights-act-timeline/\nDetails: https:/
 /www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/united-kingdom.html#uk-upcoming\n\nFo
 r information only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 Octob
 er 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/united-kingdom.html#uk-upco
 ming
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
