BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:uk-uk-reporting-upcoming@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261001T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270406
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270407
SUMMARY:United Kingdom: Mandatory payrolling of benefits in kind\, phased f
 rom April 2027
DESCRIPTION:Upcoming\, 6 Apr 2027 (Phase 1: 6 Apr 2027). Payrolling of bene
 fits in kind becomes mandatory in phases. From 6 April 2027 the most commo
 n benefits - company cars\, car and van fuel\, vans and medical benefit - 
 must be reported and taxed in real time through RTI payroll software. From
  6 April 2028 most remaining benefits in kind are mandated\, except employ
 er-provided loans and accommodation.\n\nSource: https://www.gov.uk/governm
 ent/publications/changes-to-reporting-of-benefits-in-kind-from-april-2027/
 mandatory-reporting-of-benefits-in-kind-in-real-time-information-rti-from-
 april-2027\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/united-ki
 ngdom.html#uk-reporting-upcoming\n\nFor information only\, not legal or ta
 x advice. Sources last checked 1 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/united-kingdom.html#uk-repo
 rting-upcoming
